Use attached zip:

  1. Run PocketBase 0.40.4 or newer on the cloud machine.
  2. Create any admin account there, open the admin UI, go to Settings → Backups, upload the zip and click Restore.
  3. PocketBase restarts with your data. Their temporary admin account is replaced by the one in the backup.

